{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click the Ball! is a fast-paced 2D clicker game built around frantic ball popping and boss battles. Inspired by the charm of vintage cartoons, the game embraces a nostalgic hand-drawn aesthetic with exaggerated animations and whimsical characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, you\u2019ll face endless bouncing balls and bizarre animal bosses. Click to build combos, charge up powerful skills, and survive the chaos of an ever-changing arena. From chasing high scores in arcade-style challenges, to testing your reflexes against unique bosses, to enduring the limits of infinite mode, every run offers a new thrill.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"NICE TRY!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3131930/937f453ed4d0a23c4c63c8ee6201265e292396dd.jpg"},{"name":"FASTER!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3131930/9a68f294377643ef04c6408749413fa11cbf2b39.jpg"},{"name":"NO MORE BOMB","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3131930/85d84ddc54d3239ea70850bbe1a51eb0ddbcd69f.jpg"},{"name":"STAY SWAG","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3131930/2610a13f38bb13374ab27bdacec3cca67ea957c6.jpg"},{"name":"BRO","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3131930/4bdee7dc400eb3b75a3a1ff76a976a6ccc4449d5.jpg"},{"name":"BIG?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3131930/e841626257c484430cd17440ad3331189198d1b8.jpg"},{"name":"CAN'T SEE NONE","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3131930/4422303197a7fd0ffbe13680192dc61476644d13.jpg"},{"name":"CLICK MASTER","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3131930/226c15bc38a4640abbf9792f0bf022bdf908de9c.jpg"}],"total":8},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/stor